  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be points on the parabola, <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Let <math><mi>C</mi></math> be chosen on the arc <math><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math> of the parabola, where <math><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin, such that the area of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is maximum. Then, the area (in sq. units) of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> , is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>32</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>31</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi> </mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>30</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>31</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the coordinates of <math><mi>C</mi></math> be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.<br /><br />Area of <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0107_64b7244b17f8.png\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#9651;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;hence area is maximum at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>125</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
